* MENU1 -- org-aware master menu screen
MAP MENU1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER   AT 0,2   LEN 60 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD USERID   AT 1,68  LEN 8  PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD ORG      AT 1,55  LEN 6  PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD OPT1     AT 5,5   LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD OPT2     AT 7,5   LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD OPT3     AT 9,5   LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD OPT4     AT 11,5  LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD OPT5     AT 13,5  LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD OPTION   AT 17,5  LEN 4  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD FOOTER   AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
